    "description": "The Event Ticket Waitlist Management API allows developers to efficiently retrieve information about tickets waitlisted for various events. This endpoint provides stakeholders with easy access to the status and details of waitlisted tickets, essential for managing customer expectations and optimizing ticket availability. Typical consumers include event organizers and ticketing platform developers looking to enhance user experience and streamline operations related to ticket allocations. By leveraging this API, businesses can ensure transparency and facilitate better customer engagement in their event ticketing processes.",
